{
 "about": "Film order of shots, derived from the timeline.",
 "rule": "placed = the shots (of shot_ids) that have a clip, ordered by the start of each shot's first clip on the first video track (the first track of kind video in timeline.tracks); a shot with no clip there is ordered by its first clip on any track; equal starts keep the order of shot_ids. unplaced = the shots without a clip, in the order of shot_ids. Whether a clip is enabled does not matter. A source naming a shot that is not in shot_ids is ignored.",
